      "type": "description",
      "text": "The election is approaching. Kolvar is on the radio every night. Vyktor has the campaign motorcade fueled and ready. Every week you spend governing in Ashenmere is a week Kolvar spends campaigning in the provinces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "character": "vyktor_reznik",
      "text": "Chancellor, the polls are tight. We need you out there pressing the flesh. A rally in Kravenstal, a speech in Thornfeld. Give the people a reason to vote for you, not just against Kolvar. Or, we can stay here and run attack ads on the radio. Your call."
    }
  ],
